{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07428","headline":"送子壻崔真父归长城 · 刘长卿","name":"送子壻崔真父归长城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"送君巵酒不成欢，幼女辞家事伯鸾。\n桃叶宜人诚可咏，柳花如雪若爲看。\n心怜稚齿鸣环去，身愧衰颜对玉难。\n惆怅暮帆何处落，青山无限水漫漫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07428.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07428","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}